# Plan 08-05 task 1 (VID-05, D-06, rule STIC-R44): the collision registers $0018 to $001F, tracer: two overlapping MOBs set the bit of the other MOB and never their own, the bits go into the register file at the frame end and are never visible inside the frame they describe (a CPU write of 0 then clears), and the register file, the chain and the whole machine do not depend on a video buffer (video.collision.*).
